    <panel_attributes>Additional constraints Project
--

- The effort of a project must be computed in PMs 
(“person-months”) as the sum of active months of its
components divided by the number of people involved.

effort = SUM(activeMonths of components) / numberOfMembers

If the project doesn't have components, the effort 
must be 0.0




