    <panel_attributes>Additional constraints Data Model
--

- kickOffMoment must be before closeOutMoment 
and both attributes must be after momentOfPublication when 
draftMode = false

- draftMode can't be false unless that project have
one or more inventions included 

- if draftMode is false all projects components atributes 
startMoment and endMoment, must be inside the range
of kickOffMoment and closeOutMoment

- If draftMode is true, the momentOfPublication must be null

- If draftMode is false, all the components draftmode must be false

- InvolvedIn cannot have a duplicate entry (with the same 
project and projectMember)

- InvolvedIn cannot have more than one entry with a concrete
projectId and diferents ProjectMembers Managers. It only exist
one manager peer project


bg=RED
</panel_attributes>
