    <panel_attributes>Additional constraints authentication
--

- A project member could display the inventions, campaigns
and strategies related with the proyect, even if such 
components are not published, yet

- A manager can only manage (create, update, publish, 
and manage members of) the projects that he or she owns.

- Every project must have at least one project member, 
which must be its manager.


bg=blue
</panel_attributes>
